EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Really?! You're really inviting me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}That's really nice of you!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}But here's the thing{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I prefer to 
leave things to luck. Let's decide
my fate with a game!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}If you win, I'll move to this town!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
But if you lose, you'll have to give
me your {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}!{{TAG:0008:0005:190015000C002800}}
Bring it on, buddy!
I can't do that.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gerçekten mi?! Beni cidden davet ediyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Çok naziksin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Ama şöyle bir şey var{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ben işleri biraz şansa bırakmayı
severim. Kaderimi bir oyun belirlesin!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sen kazanırsan bu kasabaya taşınırım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ama sen kaybedersen bana
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} eşyanı verirsin!{{TAG:0008:0005:190015000C002800}}
Gel bakalım, dostum!
Bunu yapamam.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Fou ? Ben non. À mes yeux, ton
refus est lui aussi le fruit du hasard,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Et un trophée de plus, un !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je te
promets d'en prendre soin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Das hier kriegt 'nen Ehrenplatz
in meiner Trophäensammlung.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Versprochen!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Heiliger Flatterball!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wie konnte das bloß passieren?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Wie auch immer!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Abgemacht ist abgemacht!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Also ziehe ich in deine Stadt!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ach ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wie heißt du eigentlich?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Alles klar!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Schön, dich kennenzulernen,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Wenn ich dann mal umgezogen bin,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}musst du mir unbedingt erklären,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
wie du gewinnen konntest!
